      "keystrokes": "cat > output.txt << 'EOF'\nRemote work has really changed how we think about jobs. It's not just a passing trend—more and more companies are embracing it because it actually works. People can be productive from anywhere, and having that flexibility makes a real difference in balancing work with personal life. With the right tools and video calls, teams can collaborate just as well remotely as they could in person. Things are still changing, but the direction seems pretty clear.\nEOF\n",
      "duration": 0.2
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat output.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
